      "message": "Why do we need a virtual class hierarchy here?\n\nI would expect phosphor-logging to be able to \"host\" every extension on its own.  We\u0027ve implemented it in a way where you can directly take the JSON and instantiate the interface-binding from it.  I don\u0027t know why we need any kind of virtual hierarchy here.",
